\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d8169fb agrikon-transform transform-type-translate elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d8169fb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><br>Elhadi M. Yahia, Ph.D.<br>(M\u00e9xico)<br><br>\n<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cf28840 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"cf28840\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/elhadiyahia.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/Dr.-Elhadi-Yahia.-Foto-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-image-6211\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/elhadiyahia.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/Dr.-Elhadi-Yahia.-Foto-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/elhadiyahia.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/Dr.-Elhadi-Yahia.-Foto-500x500.jpg 500w, https:\/\/elhadiyahia.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/Dr.-Elhadi-Yahia.-Foto-750x750.jpg 750w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-252e905 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"252e905\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: #27282a; font-family: Roboto Slab, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><b>\u00a0<\/b><\/span><\/span><b style=\"font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif;\">Emeritus professor <\/b>\n\n<b style=\"font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif;\">Laboratory leader<\/b>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Education: <\/span><span style=\"color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">B.Sc. from the University of Tripoli, Libya; M.Sc. from the Univ<\/span><span style=\"color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">ersity of California, Davis, and Ph.D. from Cornell University, Ithaca, New York, USA<\/span>\n\n<span style=\"color: #27282a; font-family: Roboto Slab, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Dr. Elhadi M. Yahia is Emeritus Professor, Senior Scientist at the University of Quer\u00e9taro, Mexico, where he teaches, conducts research and supervises graduate students, and the global food industry on \u201cfood security, postharvest technology, food science and technology, and human nutrition\u201d, and is also Courtesy Professor at the University of Florida, USA. He published 25 books in 3 languages, and more than 400 scientific and technical articles and book chapters on biology, technology and handling of perishable foods. He acted as Agro Industry Officer at the Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO) of the United Nations where he collaborated on the launching of the Global Initiative on Food Loss and Waste Reduction, and developed national and regional agroindustry strategies, among several other activities. He serves as consultant to many organizations such as FAO, the World Bank, the Asian Development Bank, the Global Cold Chain Alliance, the World Food Logistics Organization (WFLO), the Global Cold Food Foundation (GCCF), USAID, USDA, ICARDA, among others. He is member of the Mexican Academy of Sciences, the New York Academy of Sciences, The Scientific Research Society (Sigma Xi), The Council of Scientific Advisors of the GCCA\/GCCF, and several other national and international organizations, and has been classified as among the top 2% of World Scientists by Stanford University, USA. He holds a B.Sc. from the University of Tripoli, Libya, M.Sc. from the University of California, Davis, Ph.D. from Cornell University, Ithaca, New York, and postdoctoral training at the University of California, Davis.<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">.<\/span>\n<h5><\/h5>\n<div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-4ac45dd\" data-id=\"4ac45dd\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-babea0b agrikon-transform transform-type-translate elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"babea0b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><br><div style=\"text-align: center\">\nDr. Francisco Lujan M\u00e9ndez<br>\n(M\u00e9xico)\n<\/div><\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b5ed4c8 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"b5ed4c8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/elhadiyahia.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Dr-Francisco-Lujan-Mendez-150x150.png\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-image-6538\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/elhadiyahia.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Dr-Francisco-Lujan-Mendez-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/elhadiyahia.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Dr-Francisco-Lujan-Mendez-500x500.png 500w, https:\/\/elhadiyahia.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Dr-Francisco-Lujan-Mendez-750x750.png 750w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-72ffe0f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"72ffe0f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b style=\"font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif;\">Education: <\/b>\n<span style=\"color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Ph.D. in Chemical-Biological Sciences (Biomolecular Chemistry), Faculty of Chemistry, Autonomous University of Quer\u00e9taro (UAQ) \u2022 M.Sc. in Human Nutrition, Faculty of Natural Sciences (UAQ) \u2022 Clinical Nutritionist, Autonomous University of Aguascalientes (UAA) \/ Women\u2019s Hospital, Aguascalientes.<\/span>\n\n<b style=\"font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif;\">Institutional Experience: <\/b>\n<span style=\"color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Served for six years as General Coordinator of University Health Services at UAQ. Currently a Professor and Researcher at the Faculty of Natural Sciences (UAQ), teaching biochemistry, cell and molecular biology, physiology, and immunobiology with an oncology focus.<\/span>\n\n<b style=\"font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif;\">Scientific Production: <\/b>\n<span style=\"color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Author of four articles in international peer-reviewed journals (Cells, Pharmaceuticals) and co-author of a book chapter. Serves as a reviewer for Frontiers in Immunology and Lux M\u00e9dica.<\/span>\n\n<b style=\"font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif;\">Research Areas: <\/b>\n<span style=\"color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Identification and characterization of phytochemicals with antitumor and immunogenic activity (Phytochemicals and Human Nutrition Laboratory, FCN-UAQ). Study of the immunogenic and antitumor properties of a recombinant lectin and a candidate anticancer biopharmaceutical (in collaboration with the Molecular and Cellular Biology Laboratory, FCN-UAQ). Identification of biomarkers in colorectal cancer via instrumental analysis of tumor tissue (in collaboration with the Pharmaco-Oncology Laboratory, National Cancer Institute of Mexico).<\/span>\n\n<b style=\"font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif;\">Technical Skills: <\/b>\n<span style=\"color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Bioactive compound extraction and characterization \u2022 Cell and primary culture, ex vivo differentiation \u2022 Protein extraction and analysis (electrophoresis, Western blot) \u2022 Flow cytometry \u2022 Immunohistochemistry \u2022 Establishment of experimental cancer models (ectopic\/orthotopic allotransplants) and chemical induction of carcinogenesis in rodents \u2022 HPLC and gas chromatography.<\/span>\n\n<b style=\"font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif;\">Academic Leadership: <\/b>\n<span style=\"color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Currently co-supervising a Master\u2019s student in Biological Sciences. Serves as an examiner on external graduate committees and has participated in evaluation committees for undergraduate and specialization programs at UAQ.<\/span>\n\n<b style=\"font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif;\">Professional Objective: <\/b>\n<span style=\"color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">To advance health sciences through applied and translational research, and through the training of skilled researchers, with the goal of generating meaningful advances in the study, diagnosis, and treatment of cancer and other chronic non-communicable diseases.<\/span>\n\n<b style=\"font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif;\">For further information, please visit:<\/b>\n<span style=\"color: #27282a; font-family: 'Roboto Slab', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> https:\/\/www.researchgate.net\/profile\/Francisco-Lujan-Mendez \u2022 https:\/\/sciprofiles.com\/profile\/Francisco-Lujan \u2022 francisco.lujan@uaq.mx<\/span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-8050495\" data-id=\"8050495\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-153e20d agrikon-transform transform-type-translate elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id